    "type": "game",
    "name": "Dead by Skill Check",
    "steam_appid": 3353380,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353380/extras/451161b73844e57cb0429d39510da463.avif?t=1733238120\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>What is Dead by Skill Check?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DBSC is essentially exactly what it looks like, aimlabs for Dead by Daylight. I love DbD, I have a huge passion for it, and I wanted something to help me get just a wee bit better at the skill checks.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this is that project.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353380/extras/c7e649b7ee34219b15d516c4f5b70274.avif?t=1733238120\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Warm Ups and Stats</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the speed and size of skill checks, and work on your performance during Merciless Storm. Go at your own pace or push yourself and see how you stack up on the leaderboards.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three size settings and merciless storm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As fast or slow as you need</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good vs Great check tracker</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Why free to play?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project is hardly a game, it's just that - a project. Ideally, a collaborative project that myself and the DbD community can work on together, making it better and helping those newer players coming in and getting some much-needed training on skill checks, or just a warm up before hopping into rounds for the day.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project will ALWAYS be free to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Why no additional perk simulation?\u00a0</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only perk I could see the need to add later on in development is maybe the Doctor's perks, but honestly this has helped me immensely in my skill checks just as a bare bones project. At their core, hook checks, gen checks, they're just different sizes and speeds.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353380/extras/451161b73844e57cb0429d39510da463.avif?t=1733238120\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>What is Dead by Skill Check?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DBSC is essentially exactly what it looks like, aimlabs for Dead by Daylight. I love DbD, I have a huge passion for it, and I wanted something to help me get just a wee bit better at the skill checks.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And this is that project.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353380/extras/c7e649b7ee34219b15d516c4f5b70274.avif?t=1733238120\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Warm Ups and Stats</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the speed and size of skill checks, and work on your performance during Merciless Storm. Go at your own pace or push yourself and see how you stack up on the leaderboards.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three size settings and merciless storm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As fast or slow as you need</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good vs Great check tracker</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Why free to play?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project is hardly a game, it's just that - a project. Ideally, a collaborative project that myself and the DbD community can work on together, making it better and helping those newer players coming in and getting some much-needed training on skill checks, or just a warm up before hopping into rounds for the day.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project will ALWAYS be free to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Why no additional perk simulation?\u00a0</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only perk I could see the need to add later on in development is maybe the Doctor's perks, but honestly this has helped me immensely in my skill checks just as a bare bones project. At their core, hook checks, gen checks, they're just different sizes and speeds.\u00a0</p>",
